Your Copyright and Patent Rights permissions under Sections 2 and 11 to convey a covered work in object code or model weight form are **expressly conditioned (both as a scope-limiting condition precedent/ongoing condition and as an affirmative covenant under Section 9)** upon your simultaneously conveying complete machine-readable Corresponding Source (including complete base model weights, all Derived Model Weights, tokenizer/config files, and cartridge schedules) with Appropriate Legal Notices in one of these ways:

