Corresponding Source conveyed under Section 6 or Section 13 must be in a publicly documented, un-encrypted standard format (`.safetensors`, JSON, UTF-8 source files) and must require **no NDA, discretionary corporate approval, waiting list, usage fee, or decryption key** (permitting standard automated, no-fee public model-hub account login and instant clickwrap acceptance of This License and any Permitted Upstream Open-Weights Community Terms).

